"""Original Healthy Lifestyle p.8 reading only; no p.9 exercises."""
TITLE='The Benefits of a Healthy Lifestyle'
ORIGINAL_TITLE='THE BENEFITS OF A HEALTHY LIFESTYLE'
INSTRUCTION='Read the article then complete the writing exercise on the following page.'
PARAGRAPHS=['A healthy lifestyle is all about making choices that improve physical and mental health. It involves a balanced approach to daily habits, including nutrition and exercise. Living a healthy lifestyle can bring numerous benefits, both in the short and long term.', 'Firstly, an important part of a healthy lifestyle is maintaining a balanced diet. This means eating a variety of foods like fruits, vegetables, whole grains, and proteins; and avoiding large amounts of sugary snacks and fast food. A balanced diet provides the necessary nutrients for our body to function well, keeping us energised and preventing various health issues like obesity and heart disease.', 'Exercise is another key part of a healthy lifestyle. Regular physical activity, such as walking, swimming, or cycling, helps to keep our bodies strong and fit. It also improves our mood by releasing endorphins, which can reduce stress and anxiety. Additionally, it promotes weight management and better sleep.', 'Adequate rest and sleep are vital for maintaining good health. Aiming for 7-9 hours of quality sleep each night can improve our cognitive function, mood, and overall productivity. When we are well-rested, we are more prepared to face the challenges of our daily lives.', "Mental well-being is often overlooked but is equally important. Practicing relaxation techniques, such as deep breathing or mindfulness, can help manage stress and anxiety. It's also important to connect with friends and family for emotional support and maintain a positive attitude towards life.", 'One of the great benefits of a healthy lifestyle is a reduced risk of chronic diseases. By eating nutritious foods and staying active, we can prevent conditions like diabetes, hypertension, and heart disease. Also, maintaining a healthy weight can decrease the risk of obesity-related health problems.', 'A healthy lifestyle can lead to improved longevity and a better quality of life. It helps us enjoy the activities we love, spend quality time with our loved ones, and achieve our life goals. It also contributes to increased self-confidence and self-esteem.', 'Overall, a healthy lifestyle is characterised by a balanced diet, regular physical activity, getting enough quality sleep, and good mental health practices. The benefits of adopting such a lifestyle are numerous and include reduced risk of chronic diseases, increased longevity, improved quality of life, and enhanced overall well-being. Making small changes in our daily routines can lead to substantial improvements in our health, making it important for everyone to do so.']
AUDIO_ROOT='/ingles/preintermedio-1/audio/unit3/healthy-reading/'
REUSED={
 'balanced diet':dict(path='/ingles/preintermedio-1/audio/unit3/healthy-vocabulary/balanced-diet.mp3',metadata='docs/preintermediate1-unit3-healthy-vocabulary-audio.json'),
 'endorphins':dict(path='/ingles/preintermedio-1/audio/unit3/healthy-video/endorphins.mp3',metadata='docs/preintermediate1-unit3-healthy-video-audio.json'),
 'cycling':dict(path='/ingles/preintermedio-1/audio/unit2/hobby-vocabulary/cycling.mp3',metadata='docs/preintermediate1-unit2-hobby-vocabulary-audio.json'),
}
VOCABULARY=[dict(term=t,spanish=s,audio=REUSED[t]['path'] if t in REUSED else AUDIO_ROOT+t.replace(' ','-')+'.mp3') for t,s in [
 ('nutrition','nutrición; alimentación'),('numerous','numerosos; muchos'),('balanced diet','dieta equilibrada'),('whole grains','cereales integrales'),('proteins','proteínas'),('nutrients','nutrientes'),('energised','con energía; lleno de energía'),('preventing','previniendo; evitando'),('obesity','obesidad'),('heart disease','enfermedad cardíaca'),('cycling','montar en bicicleta; practicar ciclismo'),('endorphins','endorfinas'),('anxiety','ansiedad'),('weight management','control del peso'),('adequate rest','descanso suficiente o adecuado'),('cognitive function','función cognitiva; capacidades mentales'),('well-rested','bien descansado'),('overlooked','pasado por alto; desatendido'),('relaxation techniques','técnicas de relajación'),('deep breathing','respiración profunda'),('mindfulness','atención plena'),('emotional support','apoyo emocional'),('chronic diseases','enfermedades crónicas'),('nutritious','nutritivo'),('diabetes','diabetes'),('hypertension','hipertensión'),('longevity','longevidad'),('loved ones','seres queridos'),('self-confidence','confianza en uno mismo'),('self-esteem','autoestima'),('characterised','caracterizado'),('adopting','adoptando; incorporando'),('enhanced','mejorado; fortalecido'),('substantial','considerable; importante'),
]]
def spoken(text):return text.replace('7-9','seven to nine')
AUDIO_ITEMS=[dict(name=v['term'].replace(' ','-'),text=v['term'],printed_text=v['term'],kind='vocabulary') for v in VOCABULARY if v['term'] not in REUSED]
AUDIO_ITEMS += [dict(name='instruction',text=INSTRUCTION,printed_text=INSTRUCTION,kind='original instruction')]
AUDIO_ITEMS += [dict(name='paragraph-'+str(i),text=spoken(p),printed_text=p,kind='original paragraph') for i,p in enumerate(PARAGRAPHS,1)]
FULL_TEXT=TITLE+'. '+' '.join(PARAGRAPHS)
AUDIO_ITEMS += [dict(name='article',text=spoken(FULL_TEXT),printed_text=FULL_TEXT,kind='complete original article')]
